(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-admin-schemas','FACILITYWITHBOUNDARY_README_HEADER_2_SUB_1_DESC_3','Step 3: For every facility, the user needs to add Active or Inactive for all facilities under the “Facility Usage” column. All the Facilities marked as “Active” will be used in the campaign being created the ones marked “Inactive” will not be used in the campaign being created.',1,now(),1,now()),
