(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDANCE_REGISTER_README_STEP_4','What happens after you upload: Your file will be processed in the background. You will see a status update on this screen once processing is complete. If any rows have errors, you will be able to download a copy of your file with error details noted against each row. Fix the flagged rows and re-upload to complete register creation.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_ENROLLMENT_DESC_1','When a user is mapped to a register, their enrollment date is set automatically to the date of mapping — you do not need to fill this column. The enrollment date determines from which day attendance can be marked for that user.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_ENROLLMENT_DESC_2','If you need to remove a user from a register, set their Status column to Disabled. This will trigger an immediate de-enrollment, and attendance cannot be marked for that user from that date onwards. If you enter a future date in the De-enrollment Date column instead, the user will remain active until that date and attendance marking will be automatically blocked after it.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_ENROLLMENT_DESC_3','If you need to move a user from one register to another, you must first disable them from their current register. Once their status is set to Disabled and the file is uploaded, they can be mapped to a new register, this can be done on the same day.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_ERROR_1','Register ID is required — A pre-filled Register ID was accidentally cleared. Re-download the template and do not edit any pre-filled cells.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_ERROR_10','Cannot change de-enrollment date for this register — The de-enrollment date is locked once set. Contact your system administrator if this needs to be changed.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_ERROR_2','Register ID does not match expected register — A row contains a Register ID from a different template. Re-download the template for this register and re-enter the data.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_ERROR_3','Register already exists in a different campaign — The register belongs to another campaign and the entire sheet will be rejected. Ensure you have downloaded the template from the correct campaign.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_ERROR_4','Enrollment date is required to enroll a new attendee or staff — Enrollment Date is mandatory for all new users, and must also be filled if Team Code or De-enrollment Date is entered. Use DD-MM-YYYY or DD/MM/YYYY format.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_ERROR_5','Invalid date format. Use DD-MM-YYYY or DD/MM/YYYY — A date cell contains an unrecognised format or extra characters. Accepted formats are DD-MM-YYYY and DD/MM/YYYY only.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_ERROR_6','Date must be between register start and end dates — An Enrollment or De-enrollment Date falls outside the register''s valid date range. Check the campaign dates and correct accordingly.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_ERROR_7','De-enrollment date cannot be before enrollment date — The De-enrollment Date is earlier than the Enrollment Date on the same row. Correct so that de-enrollment is on or after enrollment.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_ERROR_8','Individual is already actively enrolled in another attendance register — This user must be de-enrolled from their current register before being added here. Once de-enrolled, they can be mapped to this register on the same day.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_ERROR_9','Cannot change enrollment date for this register — The enrollment date from a user''s previous enrollment in this register cannot be modified. Leave it as it was in the original record.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_HEADER_1','How to fill this template:',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_HEADER_2','Common errors and what they mean:',1,now(),1,now()),
