(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_STEP_1','Download the template using the button above. The template will be pre-filled with all users currently created in the system, split across three sheets — Frontline Workers, Attendance Markers, and Attendance Approvers. Always download a fresh copy of the template before filling it, as the user list and available registers may have changed since your last download.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_STEP_2','Columns highlighted in grey (User ID, Name, Login ID, Role, Boundary, and Register ID) are locked and must not be edited. Any changes to these columns will cause that row to be rejected on upload.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_STEP_3','This template is specific to a single register — the Register ID is already pre-filled for all rows and cannot be changed. If you need to map users to a different register, download the template from that register separately.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_STEP_4','`Enrollment Date` is mandatory for all users. It decides from when attendance can be marked in the register. Rows without this date will be skipped and users will not be mapped. Enter the date in DD-MM-YYYY format. The date should be within the campaign duration',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_STEP_5','De-enrollment date: The De-enrollment Date column is optional. If you enter a future date here, the user will remain active until that date and attendance marking will be automatically blocked from the following day onwards.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_STEP_6','If you need to move a user from one register to another, they must be de-enrolled from their current register first. Once de-enrolled, they can be mapped to a new register on any day after their de-enrollment date.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','ATTENDEE_README_STEP_7','What happens after you upload: Your file will be processed in the background. You will see a status update on this screen once processing is complete.',1,now(),1,now()),
