(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','MODULE_DESCRIPTION_CLOSEHOUSEHOLD','Record households that were locked, unavailable, or unreachable during the round. Enables structured follow-ups and helps ensure no eligible child is missed.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','MODULE_DESCRIPTION_COMMUNITYREGISTRATION','Enable delivery of vaccines or medicines to beneficiaries in schools and other communal living facilities such as orphanages, camps, and residential institutions, where household-based delivery does not apply.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','MODULE_DESCRIPTION_COMPLAINTS','Let field workers log issues raised by caregivers or the community during distribution—such as concerns about medicines, missed households, or service quality—to support timely follow-up and resolution.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','MODULE_DESCRIPTION_DELIVERY','Record household-level deliveries during the campaign. Captures delivery status, quantity, and confirmation details at the point of distribution.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','MODULE_DESCRIPTION_HFREFERRAL','Record and manage referrals for children who require further assessment or treatment. Capture referral reasons—such as contraindications, adverse reactions, or danger signs—and track completion at the designated health facility.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','MODULE_DESCRIPTION_INSIDEMONITORING','Captures post-campaign household-level data to validate vaccination coverage, similar to LQAS. Monitors record GPS points, survey responses, missed vaccination reasons, caregiver awareness, and surveillance details. Provides a settlement summary (missed children count, risk flags, coverage status, comments) and is accessible only to configured monitor roles.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','MODULE_DESCRIPTION_INVENTORY','Track and update resources stock levels at each distribution point. Record receipts, issues, consumption, and losses to maintain accurate visibility of medicines across the campaign.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-campaignmanager','MODULE_DESCRIPTION_LQA','The Lot/Cluster Header in an LQA survey records location details, surveyor information, and GPS coordinates. It includes state, district, village, cluster ID, enumerator name, supervisor details, latitude, longitude, and survey date. This ensures accurate tracking, verification, and reporting of field survey activities.',1,now(),1,now()),
