(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','rainmaker-common','CCF_PP_DATA_DO_WE_COLLECT_INFO_1_1_LABEL','Data from administrative record systems, such as revenue survey number or other property identifier, connection number, meter number etc. may also be recorded. In the event a person makes payments to the local government, information related to the payment, such as transaction number may also be recorded.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','rainmaker-common','CCF_PP_DATA_DO_WE_COLLECT_INFO_1_LABEL','We collect information/data (“data”) to improve and provide better services to you. We collect and process PII such as your first name, last name, parent’s / guardian’s name, address, email address, telephone number, age, gender, identification documents. We may collect your educational, demographic, location, device and other similar information.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','rainmaker-common','CCF_PP_DATA_DO_WE_COLLECT_INFO_2_LABEL','We collect information such as Internet Protocol (IP) addresses, domain name, browser type, Operating System, Date and Time of the visit, pages visited, IMEI/IMSI number, device ID, location information, language settings, handset make & model etc. However, no attempt is made to link these with the true identity of individuals visiting PROGRAM NAME app, website, Whatsapp Chatbot etc.',1,now(),1,now()),
