(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','rainmaker-hcm-dss','DSS_CALCULATION_OVERVIEW_BEDNETS_COVERAGE_CUMULATIVE_TWO','The bednets coverage can be calculated at different levels, i.e., national, provincial, and district level, depending on the role of the user.',1,now(),1,now()),
