(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','rainmaker-hcm-dss','DSS_CALCULATION_OVERVIEW_BEDNETS_NOT_DELIVERED_FOUR','For the national and provincial level roles, the total number of households where bed net delivery has not taken place for each “delivery comment” reason is calculated based on the selected date range and province. For the district level role, it is calculated based on the selected date range and district, for each “reason”.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','rainmaker-hcm-dss','DSS_CALCULATION_OVERVIEW_BEDNETS_NOT_DELIVERED_ONE','The metric shows data in the pie chart, where the total number of households where bed net delivery has not taken place during the selected date range. The total number of households is obtained from the application, where the intervention delivery has been attempted, but the bed nets have not been delivered for some reason.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','rainmaker-hcm-dss','DSS_CALCULATION_OVERVIEW_BEDNETS_NOT_DELIVERED_THREE','The pie chart section of the metric shows the “split” by reason for the households where bed net delivery has not taken place. The reasons for failed delivery are obtained from the "Delivery Comments" field in the Deliver Intervention Screen.',1,now(),1,now()),
