(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','rainmaker-hcm-dss','DSS_CALCULATION_OVERVIEW_BEDNETS_TARGETED_DATE_RANGE_THREE','The microplan targets and boundary data are determined during the project setup and stored in the MDMS (Master Data Management System). This metric is used to track the progress of bednets distribution during the campaign, and to ensure that the target number of bednets is distributed within the selected date range.',1,now(),1,now()),
