(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','rainmaker-hcm-dss','DSS_CALCULATION_OVERVIEW_HOUSEHOLDS_COVERAGE_CUMULATIVE_ONE','The households coverage refers to the percentage of households visited against the micro plan target. This is calculated differently depending on the user role. For the national and provincial level roles, it is the percentage of households visited against the micro plan target for the selected province since the start of the campaign.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','rainmaker-hcm-dss','DSS_CALCULATION_OVERVIEW_HOUSEHOLDS_COVERAGE_CUMULATIVE_THREE','The micro plan targets are set up in the project setup, while the data on households visited is added by the field workers in the application. The boundary data is obtained from the MDMS.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','rainmaker-hcm-dss','DSS_CALCULATION_OVERVIEW_HOUSEHOLDS_COVERAGE_CUMULATIVE_TWO','For the district level role, it is the percentage of households visited against the micro plan target for the corresponding district since the start of the campaign.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','rainmaker-hcm-dss','DSS_CALCULATION_OVERVIEW_HOUSEHOLDS_TARGETED_DATE_RANGE','Households Targeted (For selected date range)',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','rainmaker-hcm-dss','DSS_CALCULATION_OVERVIEW_HOUSEHOLDS_TARGETED_DATE_RANGE_ONE','The calculation for the number of households targeted for the selected date range depends on the user role. For the national and provincial user roles, the calculation is based on the household micro plan target for the province per day multiplied by the number of days in the selected date range. For the district user role, the calculation is based on the household micro plan target for the district per day multiplied by the number of days in the selected date range.',1,now(),1,now()),
