(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','rainmaker-hcm-dss','DSS_CALCULATION_REGISTRATION_AND_DELIVERY_HOUSEHOLDS_VISITED_MAP_TWO','For national and provincial users, hovering over any boundary on the map will display a tooltip showing the name of the boundary and the total number of households covered within that boundary.',1,now(),1,now()),
(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','rainmaker-hcm-dss','DSS_CALCULATION_REGISTRATION_AND_DELIVERY_HOUSEHOLDS_VISITED_ONE','The "Households Visited" KPI in the “Registration and Delivery” dashboard section shows the total number of households visited during the selected date range. The data is sourced from the application.',1,now(),1,now()),
